/*
 * What each boss and mid-boss does, spoken when the fight starts (after its
 * name), by Ctrl+F2 during the fight, and in Learn Sounds. Index = boss
 * kind (boss +0x10), the order of the Chara names in Name.msbt. Written
 * from the WiKirby articles on each boss in this game.
 */
#ifndef BOSSDESC_H
#define BOSSDESC_H

#define BD_SPHERE_DOOMER "A dark, bird-like creature from another dimension that flies around the arena. It dives across the stage and fires energy orbs: inhale an orb and spit it back. Fire, Spark and Ice Doomers burn, shock or freeze, and swallowing their orbs gives that ability. Beating one gives Energy Spheres. To win: with an ability, hit it when it swoops low. Without one, listen for the ticking of an orb coming at Kirby's height; when the breathy draw-in plays, press X to inhale, turn toward the drum and press X to spit it back."
#define BD_WHISPY "A giant tree on one side of the arena. He never moves. He drops apples that roll along the ground: inhale one and spit it back at him. He blows air puffs you can jump over or duck under, and drops small enemies from his branches. At half health he grows bigger and starts inhaling: float away from him, and if he catches Kirby, shake with the triggers to break free. To win: stand a few tiles from him. When an apple's ticks come toward Kirby and the draw-in plays, press X, face his drum and press X again. Any ability's attacks hurt him too."
#define BD_GIGANT_EDGE "A big armored knight with a sword and shield. He slashes down, and charges across the room until he hits a wall. At low health he slams the ground and sends a shockwave along the floor: jump over it. While his shield is up he can't be hurt, so hit him after his swings. Stars left by his attacks can be inhaled and spat back. Beat him and inhale him for Sword. To win: wait for a slash or charge to end, then attack him from behind or right after it. Without an ability, inhale the stars his attacks leave (their ticks and the draw-in tell you when) and spit them at him."
#define BD_DOOTER "A magician in a big turban. He juggles skulls and bombs and throws them: inhale them in the air or get out of the way. He pulls snakes out of his turban, which you can inhale and spit back at him. He spins into a tornado that moves around the room, and bounces across the stage, landing with a stomp that leaves stars. Later he also punches and stomps from high jumps. To win: inhale a bomb, skull or snake when the draw-in plays and spit it at him, or attack him with an ability while he juggles."
#define BD_WATER_GALBOROS "A big water creature. It spits blobs of water that roll along the ground, sometimes several at once like a fountain: jump over them. It also dashes across the room, and jumps and stomps. Beat it and inhale it for Water. To win: jump over the rolling blobs and stay out of its dash. Its stomps leave stars: when a star's ticks come toward Kirby and the draw-in plays, press X, face its clang and press X to spit. An ability's attacks work too."
#define BD_KING_DOO "A huge Waddle Doo with one big eye. He sweeps a beam whip down from his eye, runs across the arena to the edge, jumps and whips the beam downward, and fires a big energy wave straight across the stage: crouch under it. Beat him and inhale him for Beam. To win: keep away from the front of his eye, crouch under the wave, and hit him from behind while the beam fades. Without an ability, inhale the stars he leaves and spit them back."
#define BD_KIBBLE_BLADE "A huge silver Sir Kibble. He throws giant cutter blades that fly out and come back like boomerangs, so watch for them on the way back too, and he charges at Kirby. Beat him and inhale him for Cutter. To win: after a blade flies out, listen for it coming back before you move in. Hit him while he waits to catch it. Without an ability, inhale the stars he leaves and spit them back."
#define BD_BONKERS "A big ape with a hammer. He charges at Kirby, jumps and swings his hammer, and throws coconuts: inhale a coconut and spit it back at him. Beat him and inhale him for Hammer. To win: keep out of his hammer's reach, and when a coconut's ticks come at Kirby and the draw-in plays, inhale it and spit it back. Hit him after a hammer swing misses."
#define BD_DUBIOR "A flying saucer creature that hovers above the arena and attacks with electricity. It charges at Kirby, calls in small Dubior Juniors, and strikes with lightning. It stays in the air, so float up to reach it. Beat it and inhale it for Spark. To win: float up to its height (its drum gets higher when it is above you) and attack between lightning strikes. Inhale a Dubior Junior and spit it back."
#define BD_GRAND_DOOMER "The leader of the Sphere Doomers, a big fiery bird-like creature. It dives across the stage, and you can crouch under most dives. It fires fire spheres you can inhale and spit back, and drops four big fire spheres that explode after a moment. It vanishes into dimension holes and flies out of one of them, and can open a hole in the floor that traps Kirby: shake with the triggers to escape. Near the end it raises a shield that only Super Ability attacks can break. To win: inhale its fire spheres when the draw-in plays and spit them back, or hit it with an ability as it dives. Keep away from the big spheres before they explode. When the shield goes up, use a Super Ability."
#define BD_MOUNDO "A big rock-like creature. It rolls around the arena and drops down from above: keep out of its path. Beat it and inhale it for Stone. To win: get out of its way while it rolls, then attack it when it stops. Without an ability, inhale the stars it leaves and spit them back."
#define BD_METAL_GENERAL "A metal knight robot with a laser sword. It slashes fast, spins and dashes forward with its sword, flies up behind a shield to fire zig-zag electric bolts, and fires wandering missiles: swallowing a missile gives Bomb. In the second half it rides a big rocket into the background and rams Kirby, sends out small drones that shoot electricity, and throws mines that explode. To win: hit him after a slash or dash ends. Inhale a missile when the draw-in plays and spit it back, or swallow it for Bomb and throw bombs at him."
#define BD_FATTY_PUFFER "A huge pufferfish. It rolls across the floor into the walls, jumps and pounds the ground, and spits out small fish and globs of water: swallowing a water glob gives Water. At half health it puffs up and adds falling stalactites, which you can inhale and spit back at it, and a long stream of water across the floor. To win: jump over it when it rolls, inhale the small fish or a falling stalactite and spit them back, or swallow a water glob for Water and attack with it."
#define BD_GORIATH "A big white ape that controls ice. He clings to a wall and throws snowballs: inhale them for Ice, or spit them back. He stretches a long punch across the stage, and jumps and pounds the floor, leaving stars you can inhale and spit back. Later he fires three ice blasts at different angles, bounces between the walls before diving at Kirby, and pounds the ground to make icicles fall. To win: inhale a snowball when the draw-in plays and spit it back, or swallow one for Ice. Jump over the long punch, and hit him after he pounds the floor."
#define BD_LOR "Magolor controls the Lor Starcutter. Kirby and friends ride the dragon Landia and fly after it; attack to shoot at the ship. It fires stars from its emblem, throws its wings like boomerangs, fires homing oars one by one, and blows whirlwinds from its mast across the screen. Later it fires big energy spheres and charges behind a shield. To win: keep shooting the whole time. Its drum tells you its height: go up or down to match it. When it gets behind Landia, turn around (press toward it) so your shots fly at it. Its stars and oars tick as they fly at you: dodge up or down."
#define BD_MAGOLOR "Magolor himself, a small hooded wizard with the Master Crown. He throws dark energy spheres and opens rifts that try to pull Kirby in. When his health is almost gone he raises a star-shaped barrier: break it with Super Ability attacks, then finish him with the Ultra Sword. To win: take a copy ability from the stars on stands in the room before his arena, or fight without one: when one of his spheres ticks toward Kirby and the draw-in plays, press X to inhale it, face his drum and press X to spit it back. He warps around, so follow his drum."
#define BD_LANDIA "A great four-headed dragon. It breathes fireballs, spins with its wings and tail, dives across the stage (crouching won't avoid this dive), breathes fire from two heads across most of the stage, and blows a gust that makes cutter blades. Stars left after some attacks can be inhaled and spat back. Later it splits into four smaller dragons that rain fire down, form a grid of lightning, dive two at a time, and pass a big fireball between them. To win: keep moving and hit each head between attacks, or inhale the stars its attacks leave and spit them back. Listen for fireballs ticking toward you and jump over them."
#define BD_MAGOLOR_CROWN "Magolor, taken over by the Master Crown: a huge ghostly form. He takes away the Ultra Sword, then attacks with his own twisted versions of the Super Abilities: giant swords, monster flames, beams and hammers. Keep moving and hit him between attacks. To win: dodge each giant attack by moving away from where its sound comes from, then hit him with your Super Ability or ability between attacks."
#define BD_HRD3 "A giant robot piloted by Metal General. It slams its fist and drill into the floor, which is the best time to hit it. It opens its head to rain missiles (swallow one for Bomb), sweeps eye lasers out from the middle, and spins with its arms out. In its second half it bounces from side to side and fires a diagonal beam down: don't get cornered. To win: hit it right after its fist or drill lands. Inhale a missile and spit it back, or swallow one for Bomb."
#define BD_GALACTA "A legendary winged knight with a lance and shield, and very fast. He slashes, thrusts and dashes with his lance, spins and leaves stars, summons tornadoes across the stage, and fires bouncing energy swords, crescent waves and lightning. In his second half he sweeps a rotating laser and fires twelve energy swords from the background. Many of his attacks can't be blocked. To win: keep your distance, guard against his fast lance attacks, and hit him right after a dash ends."
#define BD_UNKNOWN "Listen for its drum, keep moving, and attack between its moves. Stars left by its attacks can be inhaled and spat back."

#endif
